OL,3,GNEWSAPet budgie that hid in drain
OL,4,Aduring storm rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pet budgie who ruffled a few feathers
OL,7,Fafter she escaped from her home during
OL,8,Fa storm has been rescued after taking
OL,9,Frefuge in a drain a mile (1.6km) away.
OL,11,FLuna's unexpected journey started when
OL,12,Fa window of the Northampton flat where
OL,13,Fshe lives blew open during last month's
OL,14,FStorm Boelo.
OL,16,FShe was fortuitously spotted by a
OL,17,Fpassing motorist who called the RSPCA
OL,18,Fafter seeing Luna jump down a drain.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
